                "text": "I am honored to welcome San Fernando Valley native @SenatorMenjivar to President Trump's Joint Address to Congress.\n\nAs a fighter and advocate, Senator Menjivar advanced policies to protect the health and welfare of all communities \u2013 including immigrant communities, the LGBTQ+ community, and low-income communities.",
