                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I wrote to @USACEHQ for answers to the wildfire cleanup process, including:\n\n- How the debris will be stored and transferred through CA-29\n- How transporting and storing debris will impact public health and the environment\n- The role of third party contractors in this process\n\nPrioritizing public health and the environmental impacts this would have on our community remains the one of my top priorities.",
