                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As part of @HouseDemocrats' Medicaid Day of Action, I spoke with staff at Olive View Medical Center in Sylmar about how Republicans' cuts to Medicaid will impact the delivery of healthcare services.\n\nOver half of my constituents rely on Medicaid, and many go to Olive View for healthcare.\n\n@HouseGOP's Medicaid cuts will have a disastrous effect on communities across the country.",
