                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As a result of their haphazard, short-sighted, and illegal mass firings of the federal science workforce, Donald Trump, Elon Musk, and DOGE put the public health of Americans, the safety of our communities, and our innovation and global competitiveness at risk. \n\nI co-sponsored 5 bills from my @sciencedems colleagues to put a halt to the chaotic mass firings.",
