                "text": "The L.A. area has the most polluted ozone in the country, and it is negatively impacting public health in communities like Pacoima and Sun Valley.\n\nRepublicans have 3 proposals to strip California's leadership toward a cleaner and healthier future.\n\nI am voting no on all of them. https://t.co/BN8gOomihl",
