                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "It's just past 10 pm in D.C. and @NRDems and I are continuing to fight back on House Republicans' bill that will:\n\n\u274c Give Big Oil another tax break\n\u274c Sell our public lands to the lowest bidder\n\u274c Further harm the public health of our Black, Brown, Indigenous, and poor communities",
