                "text": "The Trump White House removed the Climate and Economic Justice Screening Tool, a key website that helped disadvantaged communities facing the greatest environmental, health, and economic burdens.\n\nMy amendment in @NRDems makes sure the communities most burdened by pollution, poverty, and underinvestment are not erased from federal policy decisions.",
