                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "El Centro de Amistad in San Fernando provides culturally sensitive mental health and social services to families across CA-29.\n\nI stopped by their office today to thank them for their work in the community and to help erase the stigma around seeking help for mental health.\n\nRemember, the 988 Suicide and Crisis Lifeline is available 24/7 at no cost to anyone experiencing a mental health crisis.",
