                "text": "\u26a0\ufe0f Healthcare coverage and tax credits are at risk because of Republicans\u2019 reckless cuts to Medicaid. \n\nTrump and Republicans are threatening a government shutdown that would force thousands of families in CA-29 to lose their health coverage entirely and dismantle critical health care programs that our communities rely on.",
