                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The impact of Republicans' shutdown is being felt by health organizations who serve working families across the San Fernando Valley.\n\nI met with many of them at the Valley Care Community Consortium at CSUN where I heard about how Republicans' healthcare crisis and their shutdown is impacting healthcare in our communities.\n\nRepublicans need to quit playing games and come to the table and protect healthcare for our working families.",
