                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "From rising healthcare premiums to decreases in funding for local community health clinics, Republicans\u2019 government shutdown is hurting everyday Americans. \n\nHouse Democrats and I are fighting to reopen the government and protect healthcare costs for working families.  \n\nAs we work towards a solution, I want to hear from my CA-29 constituents on how this Republican government shutdown is impacting you. \n\n\ud83d\udce3 Share your story here: https://t.co/soAm5OHleE",
