                "text": "Vida Mobile Clinic has been providing free access to healthcare for people all across the Valley for over five years. \n\nIt is because of organizations and health clinics like Vida\u2019s that our community is able to receive the critical care they deserve without having to worry about the costs. \n\nHouse Democrats and I are fighting to protect access to affordable healthcare for all those in CA-29 and across the country.",
